+# S5-CLM-00003524
+
+Complete target-local theorem package for
+`Arxiv.«2607.05349».hasMicroscopicWeighting_iff_of_isUnit`.
+
+The package binds the frozen FC-SORRY record and Stage6 alias, gives a
+claim-owned proof without using the provider proof body, records an exact
+semantic crosswalk and proof/readability DAG, and supplies a provisional M0-W /
+R0 release candidate.  `full-study.md` is the readable proof; `Proof.lean` is
+the kernel surface; `Audit.lean` is the bidirectional and exact-root audit.
+
+Status is self-tested only.  Master recomputation and cold trust-zero
+compilation are required before theorem completion.
